      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, interactions across the APEX boundaries should be via stable APIs: C APIs for in-process comm., stable AIDL for IPC,  @SystemApi(client\u003dMODULE_LIBRARIES) for in-process Java comms.\n\nThis APEX would be for everything that runs on the host (Android) side, and would include the IVmManager binder service.",
